# Issue #2903 (P21, greenfield flag day): a writer projection serves
# `policyEvidence.organizationPayloads[].payload` as null for each
# organization state the request cites with a `d:` hint, and the client
# fills it from the payload it cited. Remove these exact diagnostics as
# soon as main contains the new contract.
GET /containers/{containerId}/writer-projection added `#/components/schemas/PrincipalStatePayloadResponse, subschema #2` to the `policyEvidence/organizationPayloads/items/payload` response property `anyOf` list for the response status `200`

# Issue #2903 P21: see above.
# Remove this exact diagnostic as soon as main contains the new contract.
GET /containers/{containerId}/writer-projection the `policyEvidence/organizationPayloads/items/payload` response's property `type` changed from `object` to `any` for status `200`

